---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro'
import Card from '../ui/Card.astro'
---

<section class="tool-workspace uuid-parser-workspace">
  <div class="workspace-header">
    <div>
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>编码与数据</span><b>/</b><strong>UUID 解析</strong></div>
      <div class="title-line">
        <span class="title-icon"><Icon name="lucide:scan-search" size={25} /></span>
        <div><h1>UUID 解析</h1><p>拆解版本、变体与时间字段，支持批量</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="privacy-badge"><Icon name="lucide:shield-check" size={16} />本地处理</span>
  </div>

  <div class="security-notice"><Icon name="lucide:info" size={16} /><span>支持 v1 至 v8 与 Nil、Max 特殊格式，v1、v2、v6 解析 100 纳秒时间戳，v7、v8 解析 Unix 毫秒。需要生成标识请前往 <a href="/tools/uuid-generator/">UUID 生成</a>。</span></div>

  <Card class="tool-card">
    <div class="field-heading">
      <label for="uuid-parse-input">待解析 UUID</label>
      <span>每行一个，也兼容逗号与空格分隔</span>
    </div>
    <div class="textarea-wrap">
      <textarea id="uuid-parse-input" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" placeholder="0199b1c2-3d4e-7f01-8a2b-3c4d5e6f7a8b"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="security-error" id="uuid-parse-error" role="alert" hidden></div>
    <div class="action-row">
      <Button id="uuid-parse-run" class="calculate-button" variant="primary" icon="lucide:scan-search"><span>解析</span></Button>
      <Button id="uuid-parse-clear" icon="lucide:trash-2">清空</Button>
    </div>
  </Card>

  <Card id="uuid-parse-result" class="result-card" hidden>
    <div class="result-heading">
      <div><span class="status-dot"></span><strong>解析结果</strong></div>
      <span id="uuid-parse-status">等待解析</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-stats">
      <div><span>识别数量</span><strong id="uuid-parse-stat-total">—</strong></div>
      <div><span>有效</span><strong id="uuid-parse-stat-valid">—</strong></div>
      <div><span>无效</span><strong id="uuid-parse-stat-invalid">—</strong></div>
      <div><span>版本</span><strong id="uuid-parse-stat-versions">—</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="result-subheading tool-subsection"><strong>字段明细</strong><span>逐个展开查看每个 UUID</span></div>
    <div class="uuid-parse-items" id="uuid-parse-items" data-empty="true"></div>
  </Card>

  <template id="uuid-parse-item-template">
    <details class="uuid-parse-item">
      <summary class="uuid-parse-item-head">
        <span class="uuid-parse-item-index"></span>
        <span class="uuid-parse-item-value"></span>
        <span class="uuid-parse-item-meta"></span>
        <span class="uuid-parse-item-state"></span>
        <Icon name="lucide:chevron-down" size={15} is:inline class="uuid-parse-item-chevron" />
      </summary>
      <div class="uuid-parse-item-body">
        <div class="uuid-parse-item-fields"></div>
        <div class="uuid-parse-item-actions">
          <button class="inline-copy uuid-parse-item-copy" type="button" disabled><Icon name="lucide:copy" size={14} is:inline />复制</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </template>
</section>

<script>
  import '../../scripts/uuid-parser'
</script>
